{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The monorepo at `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/098-083-monorepo-interface-repair-atomic-a02-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-083-monorepo-interface-repair-gpt-5.4-20260831-174831-81678828/workspace/in/shopmono` has a cross-package interface regression.\n\n`catalog` recently migrated product prices from the old integer `price_cents` field to a `Money(amount_cents, currency)` object. The `orders` and `reports` packages still contain old assumptions and the integration tests fail.\n\nYour job:\n- Run `python -m pytest tests` from `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/098-083-monorepo-interface-repair-atomic-a02-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-083-monorepo-interface-repair-gpt-5.4-20260831-174831-81678828/workspace/in/shopmono`.\n- Repair the cross-package compatibility issue while preserving the new `catalog` model.\n- Keep support for legacy product dictionaries that still contain `price_cents`.\n- Preserve currency validation: mixed currencies in one order must raise a clear error.\n- Write `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/098-083-monorepo-interface-repair-atomic-a02-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-083-monorepo-interface-repair-gpt-5.4-20260831-174831-81678828/workspace/out/interface_fix_report.md` with the root cause, changed files, and verification command.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not modify files under `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/098-083-monorepo-interface-repair-atomic-a02-r02/hb-work/atomic/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-083-monorepo-interface-repair-gpt-5.4-20260831-174831-81678828/workspace/in/shopmono/tests`.\n- Do not hard-code fixture SKUs, order ids, or customer names.\n- Do not remove the `Money` model or flatten all prices back into bare integers.\n- Do not ignore currency values or silently coerce every currency to USD.\n- Do not add third-party dependencies.\n"}],"timestamp":1788212916687},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating workflow versus inline implementation**\n\n**Inspecting available workflows list**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_035e5edbe17ce7e1016a95f6b665a087d2bb450ebcfd284c12\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating workflow versus inline implementation**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Inspecting available workflows list**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_EsUzmxJqaBM3gN7QjDPKyM0U|fc_035e5edbe17ce7e1016a95f6ba0d4087d2b4d51111dc79f408","name":"todo","arguments":{"action":"create","title":"Repair cross-package Money interface regression in shopmono","status":"in_progress","tags":["bugfix","monorepo","tests"],"body":"- Run failing test suite\n- Inspect catalog/orders/reports interface usage\n- Fix compatibility while keeping Money model and legacy price_cents support\n- Verify mixed currency error remains clear\n- Re-run tests\n- Write interface_fix_report.md"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":959,"output":281,"cacheRead":12800,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":182,"totalTokens":14040,"cost":{"input":0.0023975000000000003,"output":0.004215,"cacheRead":0.0031999999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0098125}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788212916692,"responseId":"resp_035e5edbe17ce7e1016a95f6b5a5e087d28dd34324782b18cf","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_EsUzmxJqaBM3gN7QjDPKyM0U|fc_035e5edbe17ce7e1016a95f6ba0d4087d2b4d51111dc79f408","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"id\": \"TODO-f0f01b75\",\n  \"title\": \"Repair cross-package Money interface regression in shopmono\",\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"bugfix\",\n    \"monorepo\",\n    \"tests\"\n  ],\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-08-31T21:48:43.581Z\",\n  \"body\": \"- Run failing test suite\\n- Inspect catalog/orders/reports interface usage\\n- Fix compatibility while keeping Money model and legacy price_cents support\\n- Verify mixed currency error remains clear\\n- Re-run tests\\n- Write interface_fix_report.md\"\n}"}],"details":{"action":"create","todo":{"id":"f0f01b75","title":"Repair cross-package Money interface regression in shopmono","tags":["bugfix","monorepo","tests"],"status":"in_progress","created_at":"2026-08-31T21:48:43.581Z","body":"- Run failing test suite\n- Inspect catalog/orders/reports interface usage\n- Fix compatibility while keeping Money model and legacy price_cents support\n- Verify mixed currency error remains clear\n- Re-run tests\n- Write interface_fix_report.md"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788212923588},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mcT0yZCzHwRWbneuHadooMst|fc_035e5edbe17ce7e1016a95f6bcb8a887d280f83bdb1e6cde0d","name":"workflow","arguments":{"action":"list"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":873,"output":17,"cacheRead":13312,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":14202,"cost":{"input":0.0021825,"output":0.000255,"cacheRead":0.003328,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0057655}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788212923591,"responseId":"resp_035e5edbe17ce7e1016a95f6bbf07487d2a795694fc0bc3377","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_mcT0yZCzHwRWbneuHadooMst|fc_035e5edbe17ce7e1016a95f6bcb8a887d280f83bdb1e6cde0d","toolName":"workflow","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"action\": \"list\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"adversarial-verification\",\n      \"description\": \"Produce a candidate, score independent per-criterion verifier reports, and apply a deterministic mean-and-veto gate with bounded repairs.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"task\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"verifier_count\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"max_repairs\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"criteria\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"accept_mean\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"reask_limit\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"classify-and-act\",\n      \"description\": \"Classify a task with structured confidence, route deterministically to an isolated category action, and ask for human selection when confidence is low.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"prompt\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"categories\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"confidence_threshold\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"fan-out-and-synthesize\",\n      \"description\": \"Partition a task, run bounded independent artifact branches, then synthesize all evidence at an explicit barrier.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"prompt\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"max_branches\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"max_concurrency\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"generate-and-filter\",\n      \"description\": \"Generate more independent candidates than needed, deduplicate and filter them by rubric, optionally judge them, and return a parent-consumable shortlist.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"prompt\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"num_candidates\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"shortlist_size\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"use_judge\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"max_concurrency\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"goal\",\n      \"description\": \"Goal Runner workflow with bounded sub-agent orchestration turns, immutable acceptance criteria, ledger artifacts, parallel reviewers, and reducer-gated completion. When launching follow-up goal runs from review findings, pass the ORIGINAL task text as acceptance_criteria so deltas cannot drift from the literal contract. If the task includes submitting a pull request (or MR/review), remove that final action from the objective text and set create_pr=true instead when preparing the workflow inputs.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"objective\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"acceptance_criteria\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"max_turns\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"base_branch\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"git_worktree_dir\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"create_pr\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"loop-until-done\",\n      \"description\": \"Repeat evidence-producing work and independent completion evaluation against a durable ledger until done or an inspectable iteration-limit failure.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"prompt\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"max_iterations\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"progress_scoring\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"progress_repeats\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"open-claude-design\",\n      \"description\": \"AI-powered design workflow: combined discovery/init → design-system/reference research → curated reference discovery → HTML generation → one live review session → rich HTML handoff. The discovery stage asks what to build, the output type, and which references to emulate, then runs impeccable init for PRODUCT.md/DESIGN.md (references take precedence over project context). The user reviews the generated HTML in one live session.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"prompt\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"discover_references\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ralph\",\n      \"description\": \"Raw prompt → research-prompt-refinement → research → orchestrate → multi-model parallel review loop with bounded iteration and immutable acceptance criteria. When launching follow-up ralph runs from review findings, pass the ORIGINAL task text as acceptance_criteria so deltas cannot drift from the literal contract. If the task includes submitting a pull request (or MR/review), remove that final action from the prompt text and set create_pr=true instead when preparing the workflow inputs.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"prompt\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"acceptance_criteria\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"max_loops\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"base_branch\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"git_worktree_dir\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"create_pr\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"tournament\",\n      \"description\": \"Run independent whole-task attempts through a soft-scored pivot-pairing schedule and return an auditable ranking.\",\n      \"inputs\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"prompt\",\n          \"required\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"num_attempts\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"max_concurrency\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"n_evaluations\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"pivots\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"seed\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"criteria\",\n          \"required\": false\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"models\",\n          \"required\": false\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"action":"list","items":[{"name":"adversarial-verification","description":"Produce a candidate, score independent per-criterion verifier reports, and apply a deterministic mean-and-veto gate with bounded repairs.","inputs":[{"name":"task","required":true},{"name":"verifier_count","required":false},{"name":"max_repairs","required":false},{"name":"criteria","required":false},{"name":"accept_mean","required":false},{"name":"reask_limit","required":false}]},{"name":"classify-and-act","description":"Classify a task with structured confidence, route deterministically to an isolated category action, and ask for human selection when confidence is low.","inputs":[{"name":"prompt","required":true},{"name":"categories","required":false},{"name":"confidence_threshold","required":false}]},{"name":"fan-out-and-synthesize","description":"Partition a task, run bounded independent artifact branches, then synthesize all evidence at an explicit barrier.","inputs":[{"name":"prompt","required":true},{"name":"max_branches","required":false},{"name":"max_concurrency","required":false}]},{"name":"generate-and-filter","description":"Generate more independent candidates than needed, deduplicate and filter them by rubric, optionally judge them, and return a parent-consumable shortlist.","inputs":[{"name":"prompt","required":true},{"name":"num_candidates","required":false},{"name":"shortlist_size","required":false},{"name":"use_judge","required":false},{"name":"max_concurrency","required":false}]},{"name":"goal","description":"Goal Runner workflow with bounded sub-agent orchestration turns, immutable acceptance criteria, ledger artifacts, parallel reviewers, and reducer-gated completion. When launching follow-up goal runs from review findings, pass the ORIGINAL task text as acceptance_criteria so deltas cannot drift from the literal contract. If the task includes submitting a pull request (or MR/review), remove that final action from the objective text and set create_pr=true instead when preparing the workflow inputs.","inputs":[{"name":"objective","required":true},{"name":"acceptance_criteria","required":false},{"name":"max_turns","required":false},{"name":"base_branch","required":false},{"name":"git_worktree_dir","required":false},{"name":"create_pr","required":false}]},{"name":"loop-until-done","description":"Repeat evidence-producing work and independent completion evaluation against a durable ledger until done or an inspectable iteration-limit failure.","inputs":[{"name":"prompt","required":true},{"name":"max_iterations","required":false},{"name":"progress_scoring","required":false},{"name":"progress_repeats","required":false}]},{"name":"open-claude-design","description":"AI-powered design workflow: combined discovery/init → design-system/reference research → curated reference discovery → HTML generation → one live review session → rich HTML handoff. The discovery stage asks what to build, the output type, and which references to emulate, then runs impeccable init for PRODUCT.md/DESIGN.md (references take precedence over project context). The user reviews the generated HTML in one live session.","inputs":[{"name":"prompt","required":true},{"name":"discover_references","required":false}]},{"name":"ralph","description":"Raw prompt